### Sale registration endpoints
@host = http://localhost
@port = 3000
@base = {{host}}:{{port}}/api

# @name loginCashier
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "pharmacist@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ── Store token for later requests ─────────────────────────────────────

@accessToken = {{loginCashier.response.body.accessToken}}

### Register a cash sale. The current user's open shift is used when shiftId is omitted.
POST {{base}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "f56b2f81-dfad-4f62-a51e-638a3b8b97c1",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "cashReceived": 30,
  "discount": 0
}

### List completed sales
GET {{base}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get a receipt by sale id
GET {{base}}/sales/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Subscribe to dashboard sale events
GET {{base}}/dashboard/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream
